# Line-ending normalization.
#
# This repo is developed across Linux and macOS machines that share the working
# tree via Syncthing (see NOTES.md / WIP.md). Because the *same bytes* are synced
# to every machine, we force LF on checkout everywhere — otherwise a CRLF checkout
# would propagate to the other clones and git there would report the entire tree as
# "modified" (a phantom whole-tree diff with zero content changes). Pinning
# `eol=lf` keeps every machine byte-identical.
* text=auto eol=lf
